       DERIVE-STATUS-CODE-0059.
               INSPECT WS-KEY-CHAR REPLACING ALL SPACES BY '0'.
               IF WS-STATUS-FAILED
                  PERFORM WRITE-ERROR-MESSAGE
               END-IF.
      *----------------------------------------------------------------*
       FILE-ACCESS-0060.
               EXEC CICS WRITE FILE('KSDSPA74')
